{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1302869-purview-questions","id":1302869,"title":"Purview Questions","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-04-05T11:08:30-07:00","id":1302869,"title":"Purview Questions","content":"Quick questions:<br /> <br /> An Origin level character that get access to a Birthright that gives access to a purview gains the related Inate powers?<br /> <br /> A hero gains access to any inate power the character have access to the purview, even for recently gathered or borrowed relics?<br /> <br /> A hero\u2019s can always use marvels from the PSP? It makes absolutely all the Theoi scions shapeshifters masters of disguise and all the Aesir seers (if carring runes around).<br /> <br /> Can a hero create marvels related to their callings, like using a knack he doesn\u2019t have related to the calling and not to the purview?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-06T00:40:26-07:00","id":1303030,"title":"","content":"1. No, you get zero benefits from Purviews at Origin level, including no Innate, so taking Purview access with Origin Birthrights is useless and not recommended.<br /> <br /> 2. A Hero gains access to any Innate for any Purview they have access to, no matter how recently acquired.<br /> <br /> 3. You can use Marvels from any Purview you have access to... And since you can never <i> lose </i> access to your PSP, you are always able to use Marvels from it.<br /> <br /> 4. No, Marvels are a Purview only thing... That said, many Purviews have overlap with Callings... You can't do a Healer Marvel, for example, but you <i>can</i> do a Health Marvel to get the same effect.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1344-samudra","name":"Samudra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1344_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"497"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}